量"}],"kind":"dataset","limitations":["Source: National Bureau of Statistics of China, July 2026 and August 2026 industrial production releases. This is a curated factual excerpt of 36 published product categories, not the full 626-product statistics database or a mirror of the articles.","Both original article URLs and individual publication dates are retained per row. SourceInput published_at is the later release date for this two-release compilation, not the initial availability of the July observation. Acquired times identify these actual downloads; no historical PIT certification.","Monthly absolute product output is the reader value. Published monthly YoY, YTD absolute values and YTD YoY are separate original fields; no YTD subtraction, back-calculated history or growth-rate-as-output is performed.","Scope is enterprises with annual principal-business revenue of CNY20 million or above. Published comparable-base growth can differ from ratios of separately published prior-year levels due to changing enterprise scope; do not infer constant micro-sample, seasonally adjusted levels or economy-wide full production.","Total products and included subcategories overlap, e.g. automobiles/NEVs, nonferrous metals/aluminium, electricity/generation types. They must not be summed as independent quantities. Units remain the original Chinese statistical units; MW-equivalence or value conversions are not inferred.","July and August source tables each appear twice in the HTML layout. Identical 36-row blocks were verified and counted once per release. 72 monthly levels and 216 accompanying published factual cells were extracted from the 288 original numerical cells.","These are published statistical-category comparisons. They are not prices, inventory, company operating exposure, continuous surveillance or 36 newly monitored distinct commodities. Missing physical detail is not filled with a manufactured grade.","Necessary factual numbers, attribution and original organization only; no general open-data licence or permission to republish the full website is inferred from public access.","ORIGINAL_URL=https://www.stats.gov.cn/sj/zxfbhjd/202608/t20260817_1965055.html; HTTP=200; BYTES=393334; SHA256=14cb3c2f8eaadbec92b9eb7f3d30495308444cfd17b7b87d2f4178f3394d8ae1; ACQUIRED=2026-10-17T09:45:43.389432+00:00","ORIGINAL_URL=https://www.stats.gov.cn/sj/zxfb/202609/t20260915_1965308.html; HTTP=200; BYTES=411119; SHA256=ea8ea06141f0163ac0db50c50b2bf12c8ad602b18bcb1dbfaa96b59ff0950439; ACQUIRED=2026-10-17T09:43:17.127354+00:00"],"origin":"https://www.stats.gov.cn/sj/zxfb/","published_at":"2026-09-15","report_period":"2026-07-01/2026-08-31","source_id":"nbs-industrial-product-output-monthly","title":"国家统计局2026年7、8月36类工业产品产量：两篇原表必要数字摘录"},"representation":{"path":"source-views/nbs-industrial-product-output-monthly/f64298d3c83bcff568f327fd85690ac21242721f0534a455535949dfcd717e3f/data.csv","sha256":"ef6804111951f4a9e18a55fdb8fcaebc58e857cd30bfd5f9b762ad5446625114","size":27169},"schema":"source-version-v1","stored_at":"2026-10-17T09:53:01.179568+00:00","version_id":"f64298d3c83bcff568f327fd85690ac21242721f0534a455535949dfcd717e3f"}
